The free assets of nemesio -- every file in this folder: the pictures, the maps,
the stage and shared tables, the texts, the music and the sound effects -- are
Copyright (c) 2026 truizsanchez, and are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You may share and adapt them for any purpose, even commercially, as long as you
give appropriate credit ("nemesio free assets, by truizsanchez, CC BY 4.0"),
link to the licence, and say if you changed them.

No picture, map, text, tune or sound in them is copied out of Konami's cartridge:
they were drawn, composed and worked out for this project
(tools/make_free_assets.py generates them). The tables play by the original's
rules, and a few small ones share many of their values with the original's.
